<title>UK: Scholl names Marchetti finance director.</title>
<headline>Scholl names Marchetti finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British shoemaker Scholl Plc said on Wednesday it named Charles Marchetti as group finance director, effective July 1.</p>
<p>Marchetti joins from SmithKline Beecham Plc, where he had been on secondment to their Italian business as vice president and finance director.</p>
<p>Marchetti succeeds Judy Stammers, who resigned from the group following the relocation of the company's head office to Luton from Windsor.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
